<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Today's routes — Error State</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@600;650;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <style>
    /* Design System Tokens */
    :root {
      --bg: #F7F7F7;
      --surface: #FFFFFF;
      --text: #202020;
      --text-quiet: #626262;
      --border: #D5D5D5;
      --primary: #A94B1D;
      --status-good: #24704B;
      --status-waiting: #805800;
      --status-failed: #AE2C2C;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .font-heading {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
    }

    .font-mono-val {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }

    /* Motion Tokens & Keyframes */
    @keyframes entranceFade {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(6px);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes savedHandoff {
      0% {
        opacity: 0.6;
        transform: translateY(8px);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes waitingBreathe {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    .animate-entrance {
      animation: entranceFade 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }

    .animate-handoff {
      animation: savedHandoff 260ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }

    .waiting-pulse {
      animation: waitingBreathe 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, ::before, ::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
    }

    /* Interactive control states */
    .btn-primary {
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 24px;
      transition: background-color 150ms ease, transform 90ms ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #8c3c14;
    }
    .btn-primary:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .btn-primary:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: var(--surface);
      color: var(--text);
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-weight: 500;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 20px;
      transition: background-color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease, transform 90ms ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: #F0F0F0;
      border-color: #BCBCBC;
    }
    .btn-secondary:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .btn-secondary:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }

    .panel-base {
      background-color: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen text-[#202020]">

  <!-- Header: Exact per spec -->
  <header class="bg-[#FFFFFF] border-b border-[#D5D5D5] sticky top-0 z-30">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <!-- Left: Logo & Nav -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 bg-[#202020] text-[#FFFFFF] font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] font-heading select-none">
            M
          </div>
          <span class="font-heading font-bold text-lg tracking-tight text-[#202020]">Meridian</span>
        </div>
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium">
          <a href="#" class="text-[#A94B1D] font-semibold border-b-2 border-[#A94B1D] py-5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#A94B1D] transition-colors" aria-current="page">Today's routes</a>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#626262] hover:text-[#202020] py-5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#A94B1D] transition-colors">Pending work</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: User & Language -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5 text-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 bg-[#EFEFEF] text-[#202020] text-xs font-semibold rounded-[2px] flex items-center justify-center border border-[#D5D5D5] font-mono-val">
            TM
          </span>
          <span class="text-[#202020] font-medium">Tariq Mansour · Driver</span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-4 w-px bg-[#D5D5D5]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="text-[#626262] text-xs font-medium">
          <span class="text-[#202020] font-semibold">EN</span> / <span>العربية</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Container -->
  <main class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 py-8 animate-entrance">
    
    <!-- Page's one heading -->
    <div class="mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-[28px] leading-[34px] font-[650] font-heading text-[#202020]">Today's routes</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Error State Alert Banner -->
    <section class="panel-base p-6 mb-8 border-[#AE2C2C] bg-[#FFFFFF] relative" role="alert" aria-live="assertive">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#AE2C2C] mt-1.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-[600] font-heading text-[#AE2C2C] leading-snug">
              Failed to load route telemetry and schedule data
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#626262] mt-1 leading-normal">
              The service could not synchronize route constraints and cached limits for schedule <span class="font-mono-val text-[#202020]">14 May 2026</span>. Assigned route telemetry could not be fully resolved.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="shrink-0 flex items-center gap-3">
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary h-12 text-sm px-6 font-semibold border-[#D5D5D5] hover:border-[#202020]">
            Retry
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Lead Route Card: R-204 with Error / Disconnected State -->
    <section class="panel-base p-6 mb-8">
      <!-- Card Header: Route ID, Status, Connectivity & Cached-at time -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between pb-6 border-b border-[#D5D5D5] gap-4">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#626262]">Route</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-[650] font-heading font-mono-val text-[#202020]">R-204</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#AE2C2C]">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#AE2C2C]"></span>
              failed
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#626262] mt-1">Confirmed delivery schedule for North Quay Warehouse dispatch</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-left sm:text-right text-xs leading-relaxed">
          <div class="flex sm:justify-end items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-[#626262]">Connectivity:</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-[#AE2C2C]">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#AE2C2C]"></span>
              failed (offline)
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[#626262] mt-0.5">
            Cached at: <span class="font-mono-val text-[#202020]">14 May 2026 09:30 BST</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Route Details Grid with Tariq's Van Photo -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mt-6">
        
        <!-- Left: Real Photo of VAN-27 Plate MTR-482 (4:3 ratio) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col">
          <div class="border border-[#D5D5D5] rounded-[2px] overflow-hidden bg-[#FFFFFF]">
            <img 
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AEtjO1V6kxYXeODWvoVpe_AFHY4zsq216s3f0d3gRHvPhp40XlRK89pWY1jPW_fFhbYpRHAg1_GLjHxB-FI97c57LzSDBD1Hkjp0ljamOnEHEiCjXr-WXPbXNQohpZVStaEUMYdNNPm4wCbrUKRHPk9LUzi8cPB4mbUsQFeYIrxYsTYCb9B7tJ5XwjSuUWt4duyQ8iGzf2XMDVg_eov4oLCi_E4150eyJh3A7ZJyCpDoqQIYq3sgPEIJV-QGZSw" 
              alt="White refrigerated courier van VAN-27 plate MTR-482 parked at North Quay loading bay 12" 
              class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover block"
            >
            <div class="p-3 border-t border-[#D5D5D5] flex items-center justify-between text-xs bg-[#FFFFFF]">
              <span class="font-mono-val font-semibold text-[#202020]">VAN-27 · MTR-482</span>
              <span class="text-[#626262]">Refrigerated courier van</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Route Assignment Fields & Primary CTA -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            
            <!-- Driver Assignment -->
            <div class="p-4 border border-[#D5D5D5] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FFFFFF]">
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mb-1">Assigned driver</span>
              <span class="block text-base font-semibold text-[#202020]">Tariq Mansour</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mt-1">Driver credentials verified</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Planned Departure -->
            <div class="p-4 border border-[#D5D5D5] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FFFFFF]">
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mb-1">Planned departure</span>
              <span class="block text-base font-semibold font-mono-val text-[#202020]">14 May 2026 15:00 BST</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mt-1">North Quay loading bay 12</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Consigned Cargo Scope -->
            <div class="p-4 border border-[#D5D5D5] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FFFFFF]">
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mb-1">Consigned cargo scope</span>
              <span class="block text-base font-semibold font-mono-val text-[#202020]">Order 0-299</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mt-1">20 packs in B-701 &amp; B-702</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Thermal Packaging Condition -->
            <div class="p-4 border border-[#D5D5D5] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FFFFFF]">
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mb-1">Thermal packaging condition</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#AE2C2C] mt-0.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#AE2C2C]"></span>
                telemetry failed
              </span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262] mt-1">Profile v3 (2–8°C) cached read</span>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Single Primary Path Control: Route stops -->
          <div>
            <a href="#" class="btn-primary w-full text-base">
              Route stops
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Ordered Stops Section -->
    <section class="panel-base p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-[#D5D5D5]">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] leading-6 font-[650] font-heading text-[#202020]">Ordered stops</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#626262] mt-0.5">1 ordered stop scheduled for route R-204</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono-val text-[#626262]">Sequence 01</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Stop Row: Generous touch-sized row -->
      <div class="mt-4 border border-[#D5D5D5] rounded-[2px] p-5 bg-[#FFFFFF] flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[2px] bg-[#202020] text-[#FFFFFF] font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-mono-val shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            1
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 flex-wrap">
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#202020]">Cedar Clinic</h3>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#AE2C2C]">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#AE2C2C]"></span>
                unverified telemetry
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#626262] mt-0.5">42 River Road, London</p>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#626262] mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
              <span>Customer: <strong class="font-normal text-[#202020]">Cedar Health (Hana Youssef)</strong></span>
              <span>·</span>
              <span>Consignment: <strong class="font-normal font-mono-val text-[#202020]">Order 0-299</strong></span>
              <span>·</span>
              <span>Product: <strong class="font-normal text-[#202020]">Insulin Glargine (IG-2511)</strong></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="md:text-right border-t md:border-t-0 pt-3 md:pt-0 border-[#D5D5D5]">
          <span class="block text-xs text-[#626262]">Planned stop</span>
          <span class="block text-xl font-[650] font-mono-val text-[#202020] mt-0.5">15:00 BST</span>
          <span class="block text-xs font-mono-val text-[#626262] mt-0.5">14 May 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- System & Offline Cache Explanation Note -->
    <section class="panel-base p-4 border-[#D5D5D5] bg-[#FFFFFF]">
      <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#626262]">
        This installable web app caches today's assigned route; offline actions remain tied to Tariq, whereas route/customer cache clears on sign-out, workday end or refused access.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
